aqua: \citet{Margot2023}; violet: \citet{Mason2024}; left-edge ticks:
\citet{Price2020}. Grey dotted: EIRP $\propto d^{2}$ at constant received
flux. Green dashed: the Arecibo \ArecGHz-GHz benchmark, a power scale only.
The vertical coordinates are not comparable completeness limits: each
