continuum column, so a row's two limits are comparable; its per-channel
flux-density threshold uses the carrier lane's per-channel noise rather than
the tabulated \texttt{rms\_mJy}, the two differing by $5\times G(r)$. Bands~6 and~7 supply \PctBandsSixSeven{} per cent of the
windows.



